{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "CASTILLO: The Nine Circles",
    "steam_appid": 2293880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/75c73f24dd99289c91b005f859e4f587.poster.avif?t=1754448351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/75c73f24dd99289c91b005f859e4f587.webm?t=1754448351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Castillo: The Nine Circles</strong> is a retro FPS Collectathon mixing the exploration from 90\u2019s platformers with all the carnage you love from the best 90\u2019s shooters. Collect power shards hidden in each circle of hell to unlock new areas in the hub and open 9 diverse worlds.<br><br>Your killer has traveled back in time to torture your past self, even if he must rip apart time to keep you there. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/9432f48a873857a31d97b3bf39c31478.poster.avif?t=1754448351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/9432f48a873857a31d97b3bf39c31478.webm?t=1754448351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock unique abilities to make it easier to traverse each world.<br></li><li>Destroy a wide cast of monsters with an arsenal of deadly weapons.<br></li><li>Build up large combos for a speed boost.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/1e9e5f8756e33c68bd58312b8be0a76b.poster.avif?t=1754448351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/1e9e5f8756e33c68bd58312b8be0a76b.webm?t=1754448351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in the 9 circles of hell, each inspired by Dante\u2019s Inferno and teeming with secrets.<br></li><li>Meet an unforgettable cast of characters along with a horde of shiny collectables.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/75c73f24dd99289c91b005f859e4f587.poster.avif?t=1754448351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/75c73f24dd99289c91b005f859e4f587.webm?t=1754448351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Castillo: The Nine Circles</strong> is a retro FPS Collectathon mixing the exploration from 90\u2019s platformers with all the carnage you love from the best 90\u2019s shooters. Collect power shards hidden in each circle of hell to unlock new areas in the hub and open 9 diverse worlds.<br><br>Your killer has traveled back in time to torture your past self, even if he must rip apart time to keep you there. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/9432f48a873857a31d97b3bf39c31478.poster.avif?t=1754448351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/9432f48a873857a31d97b3bf39c31478.webm?t=1754448351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock unique abilities to make it easier to traverse each world.<br></li><li>Destroy a wide cast of monsters with an arsenal of deadly weapons.<br></li><li>Build up large combos for a speed boost.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/1e9e5f8756e33c68bd58312b8be0a76b.poster.avif?t=1754448351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293880/extras/1e9e5f8756e33c68bd58312b8be0a76b.webm?t=1754448351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in the 9 circles of hell, each inspired by Dante\u2019s Inferno and teeming with secrets.<br></li><li>Meet an unforgettable cast of characters along with a horde of shiny collectables.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "CASTILLO: The Nine Circles is an FPS Collectathon. Collect power shards in each circle of hell to unlock new areas and progress on your quest through 9 diverse worlds. Embark on a journey through the circles of Hell, using unique abilities and weapons.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cFrom the intricacy of the graphics, the sophisticated use of music and sound, to the level design that simply oozes creativity out of every pore, we can only urge everyone even remotely interested in FPS beside the trodden path to wishlist this gem right away\u201d<br>Reload Magazine<br><br>\u201cCASTILLO: The Nine Circles is genuinely enjoyable and a mix of genres that I appreciated. The gunplay is good, the world traversal and collectibles are fun to find, and though it's a very short adventure (depending on how much you really put your heart into finding everything), it's the sort of game where you get what you see.\u201d<br>GameGrin<br>",
